    dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0401/ch03#S_AlertNotify> ;
    skos:definition "This widget runs the worked example of the concept Alert notification (alertnotify) in the reader's browser on the chapter's own library, shows what it printed, and lets the reader edit the code so that the printed result changes."@en .

